frameguin (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Report which build is running: frameguin --version, an About window whose
    troubleshooting page carries a copyable hardware report, and a daemon
    GetBuild returning its version with the path it was started from.
  * install.sh installs a copy of itself, so a tarball installed through
    get.sh can be uninstalled without downloading it again, and warns when
    the other prefix already holds an install.

 -- Valerii Myronov <valeriy@hey.com>  Fri, 21 Aug 2026 10:18:09 +0100

